*> vybe-test: cobol/cobol2023_intrinsics/numval_runtime
*> origin: languages/cobol/tests/cobol/test_cobol2023_intrinsics.rs

IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. T.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 WS-VYBE-L PIC X(256).
01 WS-STR PIC X(10) VALUE "12345".
01 WS-NUM PIC 9(10).
01 WS-VALID PIC 9(1).
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
    COMPUTE WS-VALID = FUNCTION TEST-NUMVAL(WS-STR).
    COMPUTE WS-NUM = FUNCTION NUMVAL(WS-STR).
    DISPLAY WS-VALID.
    MOVE SPACES TO WS-VYBE-L
    STRING WS-VALID DELIMITED SIZE INTO WS-VYBE-L
    IF WS-VYBE-L NOT = "1"
        DISPLAY "FAIL: want [1] got [" WS-VYBE-L "]"
        MOVE 1 TO RETURN-CODE
        RAISE EXCEPTION EC-PROGRAM
    END-IF.
    DISPLAY WS-NUM.
    MOVE SPACES TO WS-VYBE-L
    STRING WS-NUM DELIMITED SIZE INTO WS-VYBE-L
    IF WS-VYBE-L NOT = "12345"
        DISPLAY "FAIL: want [12345] got [" WS-VYBE-L "]"
        MOVE 1 TO RETURN-CODE
        RAISE EXCEPTION EC-PROGRAM
    END-IF.
    STOP RUN.

